-- it is trusted. Solid hits (barricade walls, other players, map props) count
-- as blocks; the goal's own invisible sensor shells do NOT (verified: the
-- `Goal` and `Goalkeeper` parts answer rays but never stop the ball), and
-- neither do visual ball copies or the player-only Lintel air wall.
